    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>DISCLAIMER: I've made the tough decision to stop working on Fly With Friends. See the Discord for more information</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly With Friends</strong> is a social multiplayer flying game. Relax, explore, and fly...with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE TO THE SKIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island and make new friends! Engage in epic aerial dogfights, blast balloons (or other players) with your egg cannon, and conquer nail-biting race courses! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/07ed220fccc98e1cc35c50cf2edcd6a0.poster.avif?t=1750981445\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/07ed220fccc98e1cc35c50cf2edcd6a0.webm?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/07ed220fccc98e1cc35c50cf2edcd6a0.mp4?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STYLE YOUR PILOT &amp; RIDE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself by decking out your egg pilot with a variety of cool skins and fun accessories. Earn a plane-load of money, unlock upgrades, and get tons of rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/00269cd84812bd837a433c1a9a3772fe.poster.avif?t=1750981445\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/00269cd84812bd837a433c1a9a3772fe.webm?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/00269cd84812bd837a433c1a9a3772fe.mp4?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER THE ISLAND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on a vibrant island teeming with hidden lore, quirky quests, and secret surprises. Uncover scattered lore markers and explore diverse landscapes that reveal the island\u2019s story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/1c5599314d8e0c5d390fb98cfa7c14bb.poster.avif?t=1750981445\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/1c5599314d8e0c5d390fb98cfa7c14bb.webm?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/1c5599314d8e0c5d390fb98cfa7c14bb.mp4?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join lively public or private lobbies to hang out with old friends and meet new ones from around the globe. Chat, collaborate, and share unforgettable adventures both in the skies and on the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/b1daaf3dbbc422431a902aa5da77ed50.poster.avif?t=1750981445\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/b1daaf3dbbc422431a902aa5da77ed50.webm?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/b1daaf3dbbc422431a902aa5da77ed50.mp4?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Music: Hunter Scott</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>DISCLAIMER: I've made the tough decision to stop working on Fly With Friends. See the Discord for more information</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly With Friends</strong> is a social multiplayer flying game. Relax, explore, and fly...with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE TO THE SKIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island and make new friends! Engage in epic aerial dogfights, blast balloons (or other players) with your egg cannon, and conquer nail-biting race courses! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/07ed220fccc98e1cc35c50cf2edcd6a0.poster.avif?t=1750981445\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/07ed220fccc98e1cc35c50cf2edcd6a0.webm?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/07ed220fccc98e1cc35c50cf2edcd6a0.mp4?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STYLE YOUR PILOT &amp; RIDE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself by decking out your egg pilot with a variety of cool skins and fun accessories. Earn a plane-load of money, unlock upgrades, and get tons of rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/00269cd84812bd837a433c1a9a3772fe.poster.avif?t=1750981445\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/00269cd84812bd837a433c1a9a3772fe.webm?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/00269cd84812bd837a433c1a9a3772fe.mp4?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER THE ISLAND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on a vibrant island teeming with hidden lore, quirky quests, and secret surprises. Uncover scattered lore markers and explore diverse landscapes that reveal the island\u2019s story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/1c5599314d8e0c5d390fb98cfa7c14bb.poster.avif?t=1750981445\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/1c5599314d8e0c5d390fb98cfa7c14bb.webm?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/1c5599314d8e0c5d390fb98cfa7c14bb.mp4?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join lively public or private lobbies to hang out with old friends and meet new ones from around the globe. Chat, collaborate, and share unforgettable adventures both in the skies and on the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/b1daaf3dbbc422431a902aa5da77ed50.poster.avif?t=1750981445\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/b1daaf3dbbc422431a902aa5da77ed50.webm?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/b1daaf3dbbc422431a902aa5da77ed50.mp4?t=1750981445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Music: Hunter Scott</p>",
